    "text": "Dr. W\u0d82\u0d83\u0d7e\u0d92\u0d7a\u0d7d\u0d7a\u0d8c\u0d7a R\u0d7a\u0d83\u0d7a\u0d89\u0d7a\u0d84\u0d8c\u0d81\u0d7a, PC, Minister of Justice, Prison A\ufb00 airs and Constitutional Reforms.Colombo,18th April, 2024. REGULATIONS The Debt Conciliation Regulations, 1942 published in Gazette No. 8979 of July 31, 1942 as last amended by Regulations published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2104/31 of January 03, 2019 are hereby further amended by the repeal of sub regulation (2) of regulation 3 thereof and the substitution therefor of the following:-",
